cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NablaMimic"
abstract: >-
  Whole-body motion tracking for the Unitree G1 (mjlab model), trained by backpropagation through a differentiable
  simulator (NablaEngine or a patched MuJoCo Warp), with SHAC and PPO baselines, the nominal LAFAN1 evaluation and
  the BONES-SEED benchmark.
authors:
  - name: "The NablaMimic Authors"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/OamIcs/NablaMimic"
keywords:
  - motion tracking
  - humanoid
  - differentiable simulation
  - reinforcement learning
  - JAX
  - MuJoCo
